<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: build props-->
  <VFEPD_BuildProps>搭建道具</VFEPD_BuildProps>
  <!--EN: Open a menu to build props with a silver cost.-->
  <VFEPD_BuildPropsDesc>打开菜单以花费银币建造道具。</VFEPD_BuildPropsDesc>
  <!--EN: Make copy-->
  <VFEPD_MakeCopy>制作副本</VFEPD_MakeCopy>
  <!--EN: Make a copy of this prop. This will require you to have the silver cost of the prop available in stockpiles.-->
  <VFEPD_MakeCopyDesc>复制该道具。这将要求您储备可用道具的白银成本。</VFEPD_MakeCopyDesc>
  <!--EN: Can't be built until {0} has been researched by the colony-->
  <VFEPD_ResearchNeeded>在殖民地研究 {0} 之前无法建造</VFEPD_ResearchNeeded>
  <!--EN: Select prop category:-->
  <VFE_ChoosePropCategory>选择道具类别：</VFE_ChoosePropCategory>
  <!--EN: Go back-->
  <VFE_GoBack>回去</VFE_GoBack>
  <!--EN: Not enough silver in stockpiles. You need to have at least {0} silver to build this prop-->
  <VFE_NoSilver>白银库存不足。您需要至少 {0} 银币才能建造此道具</VFE_NoSilver>
  <!--EN: Search-->
  <VFE_PrefabSearch>搜索</VFE_PrefabSearch>
  <!--EN: Prop cost multiplier-->
  <VFE_PropCostMultiplier>道具成本乘数</VFE_PropCostMultiplier>
  <!--EN: Cost of prefabs that are bought with silver is calculated depending on their size, hit points, and cover. With this slider you can transform how much they'll cost. 0 disables all silver costs.-->
  <VFE_PropCostMultiplierDesc>用银购买的预制件的成本是根据其尺寸、生命值和覆盖物来计算的。使用此滑块，您可以改变它们的成本。 0 禁用所有银币成本。</VFE_PropCostMultiplierDesc>
  <!--EN: Reset-->
  <VFE_Reset>重置</VFE_Reset>
  <!--EN: Silver return multiplier-->
  <VFE_SilverReturnMultiplier>白银回报倍数</VFE_SilverReturnMultiplier>
  <!--EN: When destroyed, props will return their purchase cost in silver. By default this will be 100% of this cost, but it can be reduced with this setting.-->
  <VFE_SilverReturnMultiplierDesc>当道具被摧毁时，它们的购买成本将会以银币的形式返还。默认情况下，这将是该成本的 100%，但可以通过此设置来减少。</VFE_SilverReturnMultiplierDesc>
  <!--EN: Built-->
  <VPE_NeedsMats>建成</VPE_NeedsMats>
  <!--EN: This particular prop needs construction materials to be built instead of silver, and colonists must build it themselves-->
  <VPE_NeedsMatsDesc>这个特殊的道具需要建筑材料而不是银子来建造，殖民者必须自己建造它</VPE_NeedsMatsDesc>
</LanguageData>
